                        "templateField": "speakername",
                        "type": "Text"
                      },
                      {
                        "key": "I finished the sword that's suppossed to be delivered to the Kingdom of Marijoa tomorrow. Now I heard you wanted to travel over there but you're not going there to enlist! I will allow you to deliver this sword and nothing else.",
